---

Compose `Card.Header`, `Card.Title`, `Card.Description`, `Card.Content`, and `Card.Footer` inside `Card.Root` — this site's own component and block listing pages use it for their item previews.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Card from "$lib/components/ui/card";
</script>

<Card.Root>
  <Card.Header>
    <Card.Title>Card title</Card.Title>
    <Card.Description>Card description.</Card.Description>
  </Card.Header>
  <Card.Content>Card content.</Card.Content>
</Card.Root>
```
